  "prefLabel": "Lab 1303.07 Renewal License",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lab 1303.07 Renewal License.\n\n(a) Every licensee shall file a completed form “Elevator License Application” (May 2025) at least 30 days prior to the expiration of the current license together with the renewal application fee.\n\n(b) The applicant for a renewal license shall supply the information required in Lab 1303.03(a)(1)-(5) and (8).\n\nSource. #6368, eff 10-31-96; ss by #6845, eff 9-1-98; ss by #8706, INTERIM, eff 8-19-06, EXPIRED: 2-15-07\n\nNew. #8880, eff 4-28-07; ss by #10715, eff 11-10-14; ss by #14313, eff 7-11-25, EXPIRES: 7-11-35",
